    <string name="t_071">How to create one</string>
    <string name="t_072">1. Enable Developer options (tap Build number seven times).</string>
    <string name="t_073">2. Settings → Developer options → Take bug report.</string>
    <string name="t_074">3. Choose Full report (not Interactive).</string>
    <string name="t_075">4. Share report from notification or choose ZIP here. It contains private data.\u0020</string>
